w to control. It's parasitic and yeast infections. It's malnutrition. It's lack of oxygen and blood flow. It's hormonal imbalances. It's fundamental biology. Eat nontoxic, nutritious, unprocessed food. Increase blood flow. Breath deeply. Manage stress. For some, this information comes too late. You're past the point of no return, and I'm sorry (I'm in the same boat). Hopefully, the youth will figure it out and avoid what we had to go through.\n\ncc: @RobertKennedyJr", 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '337808606', 'name': 'Robert F. Kennedy Jr', 'screen_name': 'RobertKennedyJr', 'indices': [785, 801]}]}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': []}, 'media': {'inline_media': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 2, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Sat Jan 18 23:57:12 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1880766422369845393', 'display_text_range': [0, 279], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'favorite_count': 55, 'favorited': False, 'full_text': "Isn't it interesting that all the things that might cure cancer and whatnot are antiparasitic?\n\nI'm nobody, but someone who has been churned through the medical system for years...\n\nHere's what I think:\nDisease is not some alien genetic code that magically appears out of nowhere", 'is_quote_status': False, 'lang': 'en', 'quote_count': 2, 'reply_count': 4, 'retweet_count': 8, 'retweeted': False, 'user_id_str': '1682495447271604231', 'id_str': '1880766422369845393'}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 0, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Sat Jan 25 14:04:52 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1883131119908077971', 'display_text_range': [14, 72], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [{'display_url': 'x.com/UDntUndrstndMe…', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/UDntUndrstndMe/status/1880766422369845393', 'url': 'https://t.co/1rp28lKoeM', 'indices': [49, 72]}], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '69156